SUMMARY:Saturday Night Dinner Party at El Jefe in Port Credit! (November 1
 4th) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 If you can't make the walk\, please join us after this Saturday for dinner
  at El Jefe in Port Credit! Come enjoy Mexican food\, share a table with s
 ome friendly people\, and spend the evening getting to know each other. Wh
 ether you’re coming on your own or bringing a friend\, I’ll be there t
 o welcome you.\n\n**Please arrive between 4:45 and 5:15 p.m.** so we can g
 et everyone settled at the table. (Can't promise you seating after that)\n
 (Text me if you like with your name (include number of guests if you're br
 inging a friend or two to confirm you are coming- 416-915-6677)\n\nWe’ll
  be joined by members of my other social groups as well\, so there’ll be
  a mix of familiar faces and new people to meet.\n\nSee the event details 
 below.\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer and Host)\n\nEvent Det
 ails\n\n**Saturday Night Dinner Party at El Jefe in Port Credit!**\n\n* En
 joy tacos\, margaritas\, and other Mexican favourites at El Jefe\n* We’l
 l sit together as a group\, with plenty of time to chat and mingle over di
 nner\n* When you arrive\, ask for Steve’s group\n* Bonus: after dinner s
 ome of us will probably go check out some more night life in Port Credit w
 ith live music and even dancing\n\n**Event Fee**\n$10 per person\, payable
  in cash at the event or by e-transfer to [steveflemming11@gmail.com](mail
 to:steveflemming11@gmail.com). Food and drinks are separate.\n\n**Location
 :**\nEl Jefe\n66 Lakeshore Road East\nMississauga\, ON L5G 1E1
