SUMMARY:**FAMILY FEUD** (Simply the Best Social Game in Town!)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 I'd like to invite you out for fabulous Sunday afternoon\; with our belove
 d party game\, **Family Feud (Simply the Best Social Game in Town!)**\n\n-
 It's going to be a blast\; with this group social game designed to keep us
  laughing and interacting all afternoon\n\n\\*Super easy to learn\, play a
 nd have fun- no experience required!\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social grou
 ps too so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\nEvent Details Below:\
 n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nmeetup.com/soulcity/\n
 \n**Details of Event:**\n\n**\\*\\*FAMILY FEUD\\*\\* (Simply the Best Soci
 al Game in Town!)**\n\n-Lots of laughs in store as we have a great afterno
 on making new friends and playing **Family Feud** hosted in a unique group
  vs group format\n\n-Groups will be divided into groups of 4-6 players\, w
 ith multiple rounds played\n\n\\*Chocolate handed out to the winning teams
  after each round we play\n\\*\\* Invite your friends or come on your own\
 ; either way we can anticipate a great time!\n***It's all about having fun
  and laughing a lot :)***\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash 
 only please) (HST included)\nor in advance by e transfer to **steveflemmin
 g11@gmail.com**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, November 15th\, 2026\n**Arrival Time:**
  Please arrive between 2:30 p.m. -3:15 p.m.\nLocation: The Pheasant: A Fir
 kin Pub (1999 Avenue - Just south of 401)\n\\*Great lunch/dinner menu with
  food/drink specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon ar
 rival to support venue)\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of stree
 t parking on avenue and free residential parking\n[https://www.firkinpubs.
 com/thepheasantandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin
 /)\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take
  bus or uber from the station)
