SUMMARY:Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Join us for **Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!** — a relaxed and 
 friendly Sunday evening filled with interesting discussions\, laughter and
  great company!\n\nWe'll explore a variety of topics\, including relations
 hips\, friendships\, travel\, music\, movies\, personal experiences\, work
 -life balance\, psychology\, spirituality\, philosophy\, the future\, huma
 n nature and whatever else sparks our curiosity. We'll keep things lighthe
 arted and steer clear of political debates!\n\nWhether you're outgoing or 
 a little reserved\, everyone is welcome to share their thoughts\, exchange
  ideas and enjoy some refreshing drinks in a comfortable\, welcoming atmos
 phere.\n\nDate: Sunday\, November 15\, 2026\nArrive any time between 5:00 
 pm and 5:30 pm (if you can)\nLocation: The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub\nAddress
 : 1999 Avenue Road\, Toronto\nMeeting Area: Back dining area\n\nJoined by 
 my other social groups too :)\nLooking forward to a wonderful evening of c
 onversation and new connections!\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organi
 zer/Host)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━\nEvent Details\n**Event: Meaningful Conversations an
 d Cocktails!**\n\n• Enjoy meaningful conversations on a variety of inter
 esting and relatable topics\n• Meet friendly people\, exchange ideas and
  make new connections\n• Relax over cocktails\, refreshments and delicio
 us food in a welcoming pub atmosphere\n• Enjoy a casual\, pressure-free 
 evening filled with laughter\, friendship and great company\n━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n
 **Friendly Reminders:**\n**Event Fee & Payment:**\n$5 per person\nE-transf
 er in advance to: [steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:stevefleming11@gmail.
 com)\nOr pay cash at the door\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nFood & Drinks\nMinimum purchas
 e: One beverage or appetizer per person.\nFood and drink specials availabl
 e!\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━\nParking\nFree residential street parking nearby
