SUMMARY:Music Appreciation from the 1980s Social Event!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nJoin us for a fun and interactive Sunday night celebrating the incredib
 le music of the 1980s! We’ll listen to great songs\, share memories and 
 opinions\, and talk about the artists and music that helped define this aw
 esome decade of music!\nㅤ\nThis is more than just listening to music —
  everyone is encouraged to participate! Whether you grew up with these son
 gs or simply love discovering great music from the past\, come spend an en
 joyable evening with friends and fellow music lovers.\nㅤ\n\\*Joined by m
 y other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with 
 lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we are
  at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks n
 orth of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we will be in the back dining area)
 **\n\n*\\*You can ask the bartender if you like to show you to the group (
 simply ask for Steve's event-easy to find)*\n\n-You'll find it's a cozy\, 
 relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere!\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential 
 side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n
 (Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Music Appreciation from the 1980s So
 cial Event!**\n\n• Listen and learn about the great music from the 1980s
 \n• Share your favourite songs\, singers\, albums and bands\n• Take pa
 rt in fun\, interactive music discussions\n• Hear some forgotten gems an
 d rediscover old favourites\n• Meet other people who enjoy music and goo
 d conversation\nㅤ\nCome listen\, reminisce\, laugh and enjoy a Sunday ni
 ght of great music and great company!\n\n**Steve Flemming** has been a DJ 
 since the early 2000s with a lifelong passion for music\, especially from 
 the 1960s\, ’70s and ’80s. Raised by a father who was also a DJ during
  the ’70s and ’80s\, music has always been a big part of Steve’s lif
 e. He enjoys sharing great songs and bringing people together through musi
 c.\n\n**Event Fee:** 5 dollars (Cash only at the door) (HST included)\nor 
 by e transfer: steveflemming11@gmail.com\n\\*No extra charge for those att
 ending the earlier event\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time be
 tween 6:00 pm and 8:00 pm (if you can)\n-arrive earlier if you like) (plea
 se ask for Steve when you arrive\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials
  provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support ven
 ue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenu
 e and free residential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandf
 irkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simpl
 y take bus or uber from the station)
